# Cloudflare Pages headers file. Applied to every response served by Pages.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# We deliver `frame-ancestors` via HTTP header here because the browser ignores it
# when set via <meta> (the policy spec explicitly disallows the directive in meta
# tags). The Content-Security-Policy <meta> in index.html handles the rest.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
